  brief: '<p>Open <a href="https://demo.playwright.dev/todomvc/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the TodoMVC demo</a> and add two todos. Write the best locator you can for each of these six elements, and say which kind of locator you chose and why: (1) the input for a new todo, (2) the first todo title, (3) the checkbox of the todo "Buy milk", (4) the text "N items left", (5) the "Clear completed" button (tick a todo to see it), (6) the delete button of the todo "Buy milk" (hover over the row to see it). Verify each locator in codegen with "Pick locator" or in a test.</p>',
